(321, 137, 'en', 'Irrigation engineering, vehicle manufacturing, industrial ecology, and land management.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(322, 138, 'en', '/faculty/faculty-of-natural-resources-management', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(323, 139, 'en', 'border-amber-500/20 hover:border-amber-500', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(324, 140, 'en', 'Rector\'s Address', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(325, 141, 'en', 'Transforming Technical Education for the Global Era', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(326, 142, 'en', 'Welcome to Bukhara State Technical University. Our university enters 2026 with complete academic and financial autonomy, allowing us to build modern credit-based ECTS curricula aligned with leading European technical standards. By merging the regional engineering and natural resource institutes, we have built a powerful scientific hub.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(327, 143, 'en', 'We believe that true engineering cannot be taught in isolation. That is why our students actively collaborate with national enterprises, conduct scientific research in patented petrochemical formulas, and participate in double-degree programs with Latvia, Belarus, and Turkey. We prepare elite technical specialists ready for global challenges.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(328, 144, 'en', 'View Rector Profile & Achievements', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(329, 145, 'en', 'Special Awareness', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(330, 146, 'en', 'Rector\'s Special Appeal: Safeguarding Our Youth', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(331, 147, 'en', 'Today, global processes are creating many factors that directly affect the lives of young people. Alongside the endless opportunities of technology, harmful vices also enter without limits. Among these, it is obvious that the most dangerous is drug addiction and related crimes. This vice slowly separates a person from health, consciousness, goals, and dreams.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(332, 148, 'en', 'For Student-Youth', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(333, 149, 'en', 'Each of you is the force prepared for the scientific, technical, and economic development of our country. Discipline, vigilance, independent thinking, and determination are required from you. The student period is the most precious time—fill it with knowledge, research, and high goals. Stay true to your dreams and chosen profession.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(334, 150, 'en', 'For Respected Parents', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(335, 151, 'en', 'Monitoring our children\'s mental state, extracurricular activities, friends, and interests is the most effective measure for their safety. A single word of advice, a minute of conversation sometimes prevents big mistakes. Stay involved in their academic journey and provide constant guidance.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(336, 152, 'en', 'For Respected Teachers', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(337, 153, 'en', 'Your scientific potential, life experience, and educational advice create a solid foundation in the minds of young people. Preventing drug addiction is not just a restriction, but above all, a spiritual strength, collective responsibility, and a conscious way of life. Let us strengthen a healthy environment at our university together.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(338, 154, 'en', 'Sadoqat Gafforovna Siddiqova', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(339, 155, 'en', 'Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Pedagogical Sciences', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(340, 156, 'en', 'Chronology', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(341, 157, 'en', 'Our Historic Journey', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(342, 158, 'en', 'From our evening technical roots in 1959 to a fully autonomous, leading state technical university.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(343, 159, 'en', 'Technical Roots', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(344, 160, 'en', 'Establishment of the Bukhara Evening General Technical Faculty, laying the foundation for engineering education in the Bukhara oasis to support regional mining and industrial operations.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(345, 161, 'en', 'Independent Operations', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(346, 162, 'en', 'Reorganized as the Bukhara Institute of Food and Light Industry Technology, expanding into dedicated chemical technology, textile machinery, and light industry engineering programs.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(347, 163, 'en', 'Academic Expansion (BETI)', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(348, 164, 'en', 'Evolved into the Bukhara Engineering-Technological Institute (BETI), establishing major departments in oil & gas refining, automation, and computer science.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(349, 165, 'en', 'Unified BSTU (Decree PP-22)', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(350, 166, 'en', 'By Decree of the President of the Republic of Uzbekistan No. PP-22, Bukhara Engineering-Technological Institute and Bukhara Institute of Natural Resources Management merge to form Bukhara State Technical University.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(351, 167, 'en', 'Complete Autonomy', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(352, 168, 'en', 'Effective January 1, 2026, BSTU is granted full academic, organizational, and financial independence to implement independent credit systems and accelerate QS rankings.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(353, 170, 'en', '1959', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(354, 171, 'en', 'Technical Roots', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(355, 172, 'en', 'Establishment of the Bukhara Evening General Technical Faculty, laying the foundation for engineering education in the Bukhara oasis to support regional mining and industrial operations.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(356, 173, 'en', '1978', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(357, 174, 'en', 'Independent Operations', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(358, 175, 'en', 'Reorganized as the Bukhara Institute of Food and Light Industry Technology, expanding into dedicated chemical technology, textile machinery, and light industry engineering programs.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(359, 176, 'en', '2011/2013', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(360, 177, 'en', 'Academic Expansion (BETI)', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(361, 178, 'en', 'Evolved into the Bukhara Engineering-Technological Institute (BETI), establishing major departments in oil & gas refining, automation, and computer science.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(362, 179, 'en', '2025', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(363, 180, 'en', 'Unified BSTU (Decree PP-22)', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(364, 181, 'en', 'By Decree of the President of the Republic of Uzbekistan No. PP-22, Bukhara Engineering-Technological Institute and Bukhara Institute of Natural Resources Management merge to form Bukhara State Technical University.', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
(365, 182, 'en', '2026', '2026-07-22 11:45:02', '2026-07-22 11:45:02'),
