xoro tabiiy resurslarni boshqarish institutini birlashtirdi.\"},{\"id\":2,\"question\":\"BuxDTUda qanday asosiy fakultetlar mavjud?\",\"answer\":\"Universitet tarkibida 4 ta fakultet va 24 ta kafedra faoliyat ko\\u2018rsatmoqda, jumladan kimyoviy va oziq-ovqat texnologiyalari, neft va gaz texnologiyasi, muhandislik va qurilish, energetika va AKT, to\\u2018qimachilik va yengil sanoat hamda tabiiy resurslarni boshqarish.\"},{\"id\":3,\"question\":\"BuxDTU qo\\u2018shma yoki ikki diplomli dasturlarni taklif etadimi?\",\"answer\":\"Ha, BuxDTU Latviya, Malayziya, Belarus va Rossiyaning yetakchi texnik universitetlari bilan hamkorlikda qo\\u2018shma va ikki diplomli ta\\u2019lim dasturlarini taklif etadi.\"},{\"id\":4,\"question\":\"BuxDTUning Ilg\\u2018or muhandislik maktabi nima?\",\"answer\":\"Uzbekneftegaz AJ bilan hamkorlikda tashkil etilgan Ilg\\u2018or muhandislik maktabi energetika sohasi talabalari uchun amaliy, yuqori texnologiyali sanoat tayyorgarligi va bevosita kasbiy yo\\u2018nalishlarni taqdim etadi.\"},{\"id\":5,\"question\":\"Universitetning asosiy kampusi qayerda joylashgan?\",\"answer\":\"Universitet kampusi Buxoro shahri, M. Murtazoyev ko\\u2018chasi, 15-uyda joylashgan.\"}]}},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-23T09:03:06.000000Z\"},{\"id\":3,\"contact_page_id\":1,\"locale\":\"ru\",\"content\":{\"tag\":null,\"title\":\"\\u0421\\u0432\\u044f\\u0436\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435\\u0441\\u044c \\u0441 \\u043d\\u0430\\u043c\\u0438\",\"mapTitle\":\"\\u041a\\u0430\\u0440\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0411\\u0443\\u0445\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0433\\u043e\\u0441\\u0443\\u0434\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0442\\u0435\\u0445\\u043d\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0443\\u043d\\u0438\\u0432\\u0435\\u0440\\u0441\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435\\u0442\\u0430\",\"cards\":[{\"kind\":\"address\",\"title\":\"\\u0410\\u0434\\u0440\\u0435\\u0441\",\"details\":[\