including Chemical & Food Technologies, Oil & Gas Technology, Engineering & Construction, Power Engineering & ICT, Textile & Light Industry, and Natural Resources Management.\"},{\"id\":3,\"question\":\"Does BSTU offer joint or double-degree educational programs?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, BSTU offers double-degree and joint educational programs with leading technical universities in Latvia, Malaysia, Belarus, and Russia.\"},{\"id\":4,\"question\":\"What is the Advanced Engineering School at BSTU?\",\"answer\":\"Established in cooperation with Uzbekneftegaz JSC, the Advanced Engineering School provides energy sector students with hands-on, high-tech industrial training and direct career pathways.\"},{\"id\":5,\"question\":\"Where is the main university campus located?\",\"answer\":\"The university campus is located at 15 Q. Murtazoyev Street, Bukhara city, Uzbekistan.\"}]}},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-23T09:02:26.000000Z\"},{\"id\":2,\"contact_page_id\":1,\"locale\":\"uz\",\"content\":{\"tag\":null,\"title\":\"Biz bilan bog\\u2018laning\",\"mapTitle\":\"Buxoro davlat texnika universiteti xaritasi\",\"cards\":[{\"kind\":\"address\",\"title\":\"Manzil\",\"details\":[\"M. Murtazoyev ko\\u2018chasi, 15-uy\",\"Buxoro shahri, O\\u2018zbekiston\"]},{\"kind\":\"phone\",\"title\":\"Bizga qo\\u2018ng\\u2018iroq qiling\",\"details\":[\"+998 65 224 64 35\",\"+998 65 223 28 83\"]},{\"kind\":\"email\",\"title\":\"Bizga email yozing\",\"details\":[\"info@bstu.uz\",\"rector@bstu.uz\"]},{\"kind\":\"hours\",\"title\":\"Ish vaqti\",\"details\":[\"Dushanba - Shanba\",\"8:30 - 17:30\"]}],\"form\":{\"nameLabel\":\"Ismingiz\",\"namePlaceholder\":\"Ism Familiya\",\"emailLabel\":\"Email manzilingiz\",\"emailPlaceholder\":\"email@example.com\",\"subjectLabel\":\"Mavzu\",\"subjectPlaceholder\":\"Xizmatlar bo\\u2018yicha murojaat\",\"messageLabel\":\"Xabar\",\"messagePlaceholder\":\"Xabaringizni shu yerga yozing...\",\"sendingLabel\":\"Yuborilmoqda...\",\"sendLabel\":\"Xabar yuborish\",\"successMessage\":\"Xabaringiz muvaffaqiyatli yuborildi. Rahmat!\",\"errorMessage\":\"Xabarni yuborib bo\\u2018lmadi. Iltimos, qayta urinib ko\\u2018ring.\"},\"faq\":{\"tag\":\"Ko\\u2018p so\\u2018raladigan savollar\",\"title\":\"Sizni qiziqtirgan savollarga javoblar\",\"items\":[{\"id\":1,\"question\":\"Buxoro davlat texnika universiteti qachon tashkil etilgan?\",\"answer\":\"BuxDTU rasman 2025-yil yanvar oyida Prezidentning PP-22-sonli qarori bilan tashkil etilgan bo\\u2018lib, Buxoro muhandislik-texnologiya instituti va Buxoro tabiiy resurslarni boshqarish institutini birlashtirdi.\"},{\"id\":2,\"question\":\"BuxDTUda qanday asosiy fakultetlar mavjud?\",\"answer\":\"Universitet tarkibida 4 ta fakultet va 24 ta kafedra faoliyat ko\\u2018rsatmoqda, jumladan kimyoviy va oziq-ovqat texnologiyalari, neft va gaz texnologiyasi, muhandislik va qurilish, energetika va AKT, to\\u2018qimachilik va yengil sanoat hamda tabiiy resurslarni boshqarish.\"},{\"id\":3,\"question\":\"BuxDTU qo\\u2018shma yoki ikki diplomli dasturlarni taklif etadimi?\",\"answer\":\"Ha, BuxDTU Latviya, Malayziya, Belarus va Rossiyaning yetakchi texnik universitetlari bilan hamkorlikda qo\\u2018shma va ikki diplomli ta\\u2019lim dasturlarini taklif etadi.\"},{\"id\":4,\"question\":\"BuxDTUning Ilg\\u2018or muhandislik maktabi nima?\",\"answer\":\"Uzbekneftegaz AJ bilan hamkorlikda tashkil etilgan Ilg\\u2018or muhandislik maktabi energetika sohasi talabalari uchun amaliy, yuqori texnologiyali sanoat tayyorgarligi va bevosita kasbiy yo\\u2018nalishlarni taqdim etadi.\"},{\"id\":5,\"question\":\"Universitetning asosiy kampusi qayerda joylashgan?\",\"answer\":\"Universitet kampusi Buxoro shahri, M. Murtazoyev ko\\u2018chasi, 15-uyda joylashgan.\"}]}},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T18:41:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-23T09:03:06.000000Z\"},{\"id\":3,\"contact_page_id\":1,\"locale\":\"ru\",\"content\":{\"tag\":null,\"title\":\"\\u0421\\u0432\\u044f\\u0436\\u0438\\u0442\\u