ity, taking into account digitalization processes in industry.\\nCooperation with\\nlocal industry and business Expansion of practice sites: Organization of internships in metrology laboratories at industrial enterprises.\\nRetraining of specialists: Retraining courses on certification, standardization, measurement methods for specialists working at enterprises.\\nProject-based partnership: Work with enterprises on innovative projects, grants.\\nPromotion of international level of training,\\nparticipation in international grant programs such as Erasmus+, Tempus, Fulbright, and more: Ensuring mobility of teachers and students through international programs.\\nAttraction of foreign specialists: Involvement of international experts, professors and teachers for training and scientific work;\",\"\\u0647\\u0627\\u0630\\u0647 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0642\\u0633\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u06446 \\u062a\\u0631\\u062a\\u0628\\u0637 \\u0628 \\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 Faculty of Natural Resources Management\"]}]', 'Metrologiya, standartlashtirish va sifat nazorati', 'The department began its activity in August 2019 under the name of \"Metrology and standardization\" on the basis of the newly created structure of the institute. Trainings specialists in the direction of 5310900 - Metrology, standardization and produc', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-27 06:31:47'),
(23, 6, 'ru', 'Метрология, стандартизация и контроль качества', 'Метрология, стандартизация и контроль качества', 'The department began its activity in August 2019 under the name of \"Metrology and standardization\" on the basis of the newly created structure of the institute. Trainings specialists in the direction of 5310900 - Metrology, standardization and product quality management. . There are 13 professors and teachers at the department, including 1 candidate of sciences - professor, 6 candidates of science, associate professor, 1 senior teacher, 3 assistants, 2 trainee teachers, scientific potential is 54%. Over the past two years, 2 scientific works (PhD) have been defended, in cooperation with the teachers of the department have published 5 international textbooks (with an impact factor), 3 textbooks, 6 monographs, 19 in 6 journals, 20 articles in the journals of the Supreme Attestation Commission and 5 articles on the basis of Scopus. At the department 4 doctoral students and more than 5 independent researchers are engaged in research work.', '[{\"key\":\"overview\",\"title\":\"\\u041e\\u0431\\u0437\\u043e\\u0440\",\"items\":[\"Department of Metrology and Standardization     \\n\\nKafedra mudiri\\nTairov Baxtiyor Boboqulovich\\n Qabul vaqti: Dushanba-Juma (14:00-16:00 gacha)\\n Telefon: +998 93 471 00 65\\n Email: b.toirov@mail.ru\"]},{\"key\":\"history\",\"title\":\"\\u0418\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u0440\\u0438\\u044f \\u043a\\u0430\\u0444\\u0435\\u0434\\u0440\\u044b\",\"items\":[\"The department began its activity in August 2019 under the name of \\\"Metrology and standardization\\\" on the basis of the newly created structure of the institute. Trainings specialists in the direction of 5310900 - Metrology, standardization and product quality management. . There are 13 professors and teachers at the department, including 1 candidate of sciences - professor, 6 candidates of science, associate professor, 1 senior teacher, 3 assistants, 2 trainee teachers, scientific potential is 54%. Over the past two years, 2 scientific works (PhD) have been defended, in cooperation with the teachers of the department have published 5 international textbooks (with an impact factor), 3 textbooks, 6 monographs, 19 in 6 journals, 20 articles in the journals of the Supreme Attestation Commission and 5 articles on the basis of Scopus. At the department 4 doctoral students and more than 5 independent researchers are engaged in research work.\",\"The Department of Higher and Secondary Special Education is implementing the project \\\"Modernization of the system of higher education\\\", grant project AIF-2\\/20 \\\"Improving the training of qualified engineers and professional development of professors and teachers based on personalized innovative technologies in higher education institutions\\\" funded by the World Bank for Academic Innovation. At the expense of this project, laboratory equipment was imported. In addition, improving the quality and effectiveness of the educational process through the introduction of a virtual laboratory, printed literature and software on training methodologies to improve the professional competence of future engineers.\\nToday, in order to ensure the rapid development of production processes, the increase in the accuracy of measurements, to provide in the field of metrology, standardization and certification, especially for manufacturing enterprises of the republic, with highly qualified competitive personnel, our Institute educates students in the direction of bachelor\'s degree \\\"Metrology, standardization and product quality management (industry)\\\" Special attention is paid to preparation.\"]},{\"key\":\"staff\",\"title\":\"\\u041f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0444\\u0435\\u0441\\u0441\\u043e\\u0440\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e-\\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435\\u043b\\u044c\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0441\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u0430\\u0432 \\u043a\\u0430\\u0444\\u0435\\u0434\\u0440\\u044b\",\"items\":[\"Head of the department, candidate of technical sciences, associate professor\\nTairov Bakhtiyor Bobokulovich\",\"professor\\nQurbanov Abdiraxim Axmedovich\",\"Candidate of the technical science, associate professor\\nAvliyakulov Nadir Nizomovich\",\"PhD, dotsent\\nHasanova Zebo Davlatovna\",\"PhD, dotsent\\nTosheva Gulnora Djurayevna\",\"PhD, associate professor\\nDavlyatova Mavlyuda Bakhtiyorovna\",\"PhD, Senior Lecturer\\nBoltaeva Zulfiya Zarifovna\",\"Senior teacher\\nSayidakhmedov Ravshan Rajabovich\",\"(PhD) Senior Lecturer\\nKhojjiyev Administrator Yangibayevich\",\"Assistant Khaidarov\\nShukhrat Khikmatullayevich\",\"assistent\\nShadiyev Suxrob Sadilloyevich\",\"assistent\\nQarshiyev Zohid Abdurahim o\'g\'li\",\"Teacher-trainee\\nAzimova Firuza Kamolovna\",\"Lecturer, trainee\\nYodgorova Ma\'mura Orifovna\",\"Teacher, trainee\\nKamalova Mukhlisa Khudoyberdievna\"]},{\"key\":\"prepared_specialists\",\"title\":\"\\u041f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0433\\u043e\\u0442\\u0430\\u0432\\u043b\\u0438\\u0432\\u0430\\u0435\\u043c\\u044b\\u0435 \\u0441\\u043f\\u0435\\u0446\\u0438\\u0430\\u043b\\u0438\\u0441\\u0442\\u044b\",\"items\":[\"Bachelor\'s degree\\n60710800 \\u2013 Metrology and standardization\\n60711300 - Metrology standardization and product quality management\\nJudiciary\\n70710802 - Metrology, Standardization and Quality Management\"]},{\"key\":\"subjects\",\"title\":\"\\u041f\\u0440\\u0435\\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430\\u0432\\u0430\\u0435\\u043c\\u044b\\u0435 \\u0434\\u0438\\u0441\\u0446\\u0438\\u043f\\u043b\\u0438\\u043d\\u044b\",\"items\":[\"Bachelor\'s Degree:\\n1. Getting to the destination;\\n2. Fundamentals of metrology (NM, AM, QM);\\n3. Physical basis of measurements;\\n4. Methods and means of measurement (EO\'U&A; ITO\'; CBO\'; FKO\'; AO\');\\n5. Measuring devices, elements and their construction;\\n6. Metrological support of production;\\n7. Product quality and statistical methods of quality management;\\n8. Comparison and calibration of measuring instruments;\\n9. Conformity Assessment Framework (SA; MB and A);\\n10. Evaluation of the competence of laboratories;\\n11. Comparative Engineering;\\n12. Basics of standardization;\\n13. Technical regulation and standardization;\\n14. Product quality control;\\n15. Calculation and timing;\\n16. Intelligent measuring instruments;\\n17. Commodity Science;\\n18. Examination of Goods;\\n19. Technology of development of standards and regulatory documents and their expertise;\\n20. Occupational Psychology;\\nJudiciary\\n1. Research methodology\\n2. Theoretical foundations of qualimmetry and quality management\\n3. Theoretical foundations of automated and intelligent measurement systems\\n4. The role of standardization and technical regulatory systems in quality management\\n5. Organization and planning of the experiment\\n6. Legal foundations of metrology, technical regulation, standardization and certification\\n7. Patenting, Licensing and Certification\\n8. Re-engineering\\n9. Methods of teaching special disciplines\\n10. Research work and preparation of a master\'s thesis\\n11. Scientific and pedagogical work\\n12. Scientific practice (gaining experience)\",\"Republication of publications\\nScientific papers published by the teachers and researchers of the department \\\"Metrology and standardization\\\" Textbooks, teaching aids and monographs\\nHasanova Z.D. \\\"Management Psychology\\\". Textbook. 2021 year\\nAkhmetjanov M.M. \\\"Professional psychology\\\". Textbook. 2021 year\\nAkhmetjanov M.M. \\\"Methods of teaching special subjects\\\". Textbook. 2021 year\\nUrinov U.K., Turobjonov S.M., Amirkulov N.S., Khojjiev M.Y. \\\"Construction and operation of filling stations and gas filling stations\\\". Textbook. 2022 year\\nToirov B.B., Yodgorova M.O. \\\"Basics of standardization\\\". Study guide. 2021 year\\nToirov B.B., Alimov A.A. \\\"Construction of measuring instruments\\\". Study guide. 2021 year\\nKhaidarov Sh. Kh. \\\"Basic concepts of food security\\\". Manual of Style. For 2019\\nZ.Z.Boltaeva \\\"Collaborative Learning: Philosophy of Cooperation\\\". Monografiya. 2021 yil\\nAkhmedjanov M.M. Modern pedagogical practice - the requirement of the time. Monograph. 2021 year\\nAkhmedjanov M.M. Technology of active teaching methods in specialty subjects. Monograph. 2021 year\\nAkhmedjanov M.M., Yodgorova M.O. Organization and management of educational work. Monograph. 2022 year\\nSagdullaev.Sh.Sh, Majidov K.X., Davlyatova M.B. Technology of bakery products with therapeutic and preventive properties. Monografiya. 2022 yil\\nHasanova Z.D. Management psychology. Textbook. 2021 year\\nAkhmetjanov M.M. Occupational psychology. Textbook. 2021 year\\nUrinov U.K., Turobjonov S.M., Amirkulov N.S., Khojjiev M.Y. \\\"Construction and operation of filling stations and gas filling stations\\\". Textbook. 2022 year\\nToirov B.B., Yodgorova M.O. Fundamentals of standardization. Study guide. 2021 year\\nToirov B.B., Alimov A.A. Construction of measuring instruments. Study guide. 2021 year\\nTairov B.B., Alimov A.A., Khojdzhiev M. Ya., Bozorov U.M. \\\"Construction of measuring instruments\\\". Tutorial. 2022 year\\nKhaidarov Sh. Kh. \\\"Basic concepts of food security\\\". Manual of Style. For 2019\\nTosheva G.Dj. Improving the methodology of preparing future specialists for design activities on the basis of practical training. Monograph. 2023 year\\nYodgorova M.O. The use of active methods-the requirement of time. Monograph. 2023 year\\nGaffarov A.Kh. Technology of creating interactive elements in LMS Moodle system. Monograph. 2023 year\\nR.T.Adizov, N.Kh. Kabilova \\\"Technology of storage of grain and grain products\\\". Textbook. 2023 year\\nKurbanov A.A. Scientific research methodology. Study guide. 2023 year\\nAvliyakulov N.N. Metrology, Basics of Standardization and Certification. Study guide. 2023 year\\nAvliyakulov N.N. Metrology, standardization and certification. Electronic textbook.\"]},{\"key\":\"research\",\"title\":\"\\u041d\\u0430\\u0443\\u0447\\u043d\\u043e-\\u0438\\u0441\\u0441\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435\\u043b\\u044c\\u0441\\u043a\\u0430\\u044f \\u0440\\u0430\\u0431\\u043e\\u0442\\u0430\",\"items\":[\"SCIENTIFIC-METHODICAL WORK OF THE DEPARTMENT:\\nKamalova Mukhlisa Khudoyberdievna - Production of food products on the basis of international standards, improvement of the quality control system\\nYodgorova Mamura Orifovna \\u2013 Improvement of coniferous plant extraction process based on the use of methods of unconventional exposure\\nSayidakhmedov Ravshan Rajabovich - Improvement of the process of drying gluten of locally grown wheat by acoustic processing\\nShadiyev Sukhrob Sadilloyevich - Improvement of the system of comprehensive assessment of the quality of confectionery products\\nKhaidarov Shukhrat Khikmatilloyevich \\u2013 Development of promising technology for the use of phytoadditives in the production of low-alcohol and non-alcoholic beverages\\nAzimova Feruza Kaolovna - Methodology of formation of professional skills of future engineers on the basis of metacognitive approach\"]},{\"key\":\"cooperation\",\"title\":\"\\u0421\\u043e\\u0442\\u0440\\u0443\\u0434\\u043d\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u043e\",\"items\":[\"Foreign cooperation activities of the Department of \\\"Metrology and Standardization\\\" of Bukhara State Technical University\",\"A memorandum of strategic cooperation was signed between Bukhara State Technical University and South Kazakhstan State University named after M. Auezov. This document aims to strengthen deep cooperation in education, science and innovation fields. In this circle, the issues of participation of professors and teachers of departments in advanced training programs, joint development of textbooks, as well as the management of scientific research at PhD and DSc levels are carried out. Cooperation is aimed at raising the professional level of specialists in these areas, training scientific and pedagogical personnel, improving the quality of education.\",\"On the basis of the Memorandum of Cooperation signed between the Kazakh National University named after al-Farabi and Bukhara State Technical University, together with the Department of Thermal Physics and Technical Physics of the Faculty of Physics, important steps are being taken to develop cooperation in the field of research and education. Within the framework of this cooperation, a joint master\'s degree program was introduced with the standardization, certification and training of specialists in the field of metrology. In the academic year 2025-2026, documents will be accepted in the direction of 70710800 - \\\"Metrology, standardization and quality management (by industry)\\\". This educational program is designed for two years and provides students with in-depth theoretical knowledge and practical skills in the field of modern metrological and standardization systems, international quality management initiatives, as well as quality control in various sectors of the economy. The purpose of the programme is to promote the development of regional and global quality management by training specialists in the application of innovative approaches that meet international requirements.\"]},{\"key\":\"plans\",\"title\":\"\\u041f\\u0435\\u0440\\u0441\\u043f\\u0435\\u043a\\u0442\\u0438\\u0432\\u043d\\u044b\\u0435 \\u043f\\u043b\\u0430\\u043d\\u044b\",\"items\":[\"The Department of Metrology and Standardization of Bukhara State Technical University is building its activity on the basis of providing quality education, conducting research and contributing to the national economic development. The long-term plans of the department take into account the ongoing reforms of the Republic of Uzbekistan in the field of science and education, as well as world and regional requirements. The following are the main directions that form the basis for the long-term plans of the department:\\nTraining of specialists that meet market demands: Part-time\\ntraining Nowadays, due to the rapidly changing requirements of the labor market, the department seeks to solve\\nthe following problems through the introduction of the training system \\\"Part-time\\\": Providing specialists working in industrial enterprises with the opportunity to gain an additional profession;\\nProvide opportunities for students to receive quality education in the evening hours;\\nTo contribute directly to the local industry by training mature professionals in the practical field.\",\"Main objectives:\\nRetraining of specialists: Organization of retraining courses for specialists working at enterprises in the field of metrology, standardization, certification, quality management.\\nPractical: Provide part-time students with practical training, laboratory work, internships in industrial enterprises.\\nTraining of certified professionals: Providing graduates with certificates recognized by the National Agency for Standardization of the Republic of Uzbekistan.\\nExpected results:\\nQuality personnel training for local enterprises;\\nImproving the professional level of specialists;\\nTraining of specialists with practical knowledge corresponding to market demands.\\nImproving the quality of education Creation\\nof textbooks and teaching aids: Stimulating the creation of textbooks and teaching aids containing the latest information in the field of modern metrology and standardization.\\nImplementation of open educational resources: Provision of distance learning opportunities for students through preparation of e-learning materials.\\nPrograms in line with international standards: Increase of international recognition by adapting educational programs to the Bologna process.\\nDevelopment\\nof scientific researches Modern research in the field of metrology: in-depth research in the field of measuring instruments, precision standards, certification and quality management.\\nEngage students in scientific activities through research work (ITI), graduation thesis (BMI), and participation in conferences.\\nInternational cooperation: Strengthening cooperation with universities, institutes and metrology centers abroad.\\nHardening\\nof the information and communication technologies base Updating of laboratory equipment: Providing laboratories with modern measuring instruments, calibration stands, certification equipment.\\nSimulation Software: Widespread introduction of the use of software for modeling metrological measurement processes.\\nCreation of an electronic portal: electronic control of the department, communication with students and introduction of an information portal to manage the educational process.\\nTraining of specialists\\nin the field of information security and quality management Training of specialists on the basis of international standards ISO 9001, ISO \\/ IEC 17025, ISO 14001.\\nAdvanced training courses in the field of information security: opening of professions in the field of information security, taking into account digitalization processes in industry.\\nCooperation with\\nlocal industry and business Expansion of practice sites: Organization of internships in metrology laboratories at industrial enterprises.\\nRetraining of specialists: Retraining courses on certification, standardization, measurement methods for specialists working at enterprises.\\nProject-based partnership: Work with enterprises on innovative projects, grants.\\nPromotion of international level of training,\\nparticipation in international grant programs such as Erasmus+, Tempus, Fulbright, and more: Ensuring mobility of teachers and students through international programs.\\nAttraction of foreign specialists: Involvement of international experts, professors and teachers for training and scientific work;\",\"\\u0647\\u0627\\u0630\\u0647 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0642\\u0633\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u06446 \\u062a\\u0631\\u062a\\u0628\\u0637 \\u0628 \\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 Faculty of Natural Resources Management\"]}]', 'Метрология, стандартизация и контроль качества', 'The department began its activity in August 2019 under the name of \"Metrology and standardization\" on the basis of the newly created structure of the institute. Trainings specialists in the direction of 5310900 - Metrology, standardization and produc', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-27 06:31:47'),
