bility (on the example of the Bukhara oasis), optimization of the composition of agricultural land species in clusters, introduction of innovative technologies for monitoring agricultural lands.\"]},{\"key\":\"cooperation\",\"title\":\"Hamkorlik\",\"items\":[\"The department cooperates with the University of Usak in Turkey. From November 25 to December 6, 2024, a short-term internship was carried out by Khudoyberdiev F.Sh, Sattorov Sh.Y., Adizov Sh.B. and master\'s students Bobojonov S.O.\\nDuring the internship, as part of the exchange of experience between universities, lectures were organized by professors and teachers, and they got acquainted with the laboratory equipment. Electronic copies of necessary scientific literature were brought in from the Information Resource Center.\\nAn agreement was signed with the Faculty of Agriculture on the organization of online lectures on relevant subjects in Kefedra.\"]}]', 'Department of Land Resources Management and State Land Cadastres', 'Taking into account the growing scale of tasks of improving the land reclamation state, as well as the peculiarities of the soil and climatic conditions, mineralization and salinity of agricultural lands in certain regions, including in the Bukhara v', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-27 06:31:49'),
(39, 10, 'ru', 'Кафедра использования земельных ресурсов и государственного кадастра', 'Кафедра использования земельных ресурсов и государственного кадастра', 'Taking into account the growing scale of tasks of improving the land reclamation state, as well as the peculiarities of the soil and climatic conditions, mineralization and salinity of agricultural lands in certain regions, including in the Bukhara valley, and in order to train highly qualified specialists for this important area of the country\'s economy, the Cabinet of Ministers of the Republic of Uzbekistan approved the Decree of the Cabinet of Ministers of the Republic of Uzbekistan dated August 20, 2010 \"Tashkent irrigation and On the organization of the Bukhara branch of the Institute of Melioration \"The Department of Land Management and Land Cadastre\" was organized as part of the organizational structure of the faculty \"Hydromelioration\".\nThe department was organized with the name \"Land Planning and Land Cadastre\" in 2010. At present, it is called \"Land Use and State Cadastres\". Prominent scientists - professors S. Boriev and U. Tadzhiev made a great contribution to the development of the department for a long time. The department is headed by associate professor F. Hamidov, associate professor I. Islamov, and since 2022, associate professor S. Asatov. Based on their specialties, the faculty of the department \"Land Resources Use and State Cadastres\" are engaged in various problems in agriculture.\nIn recent years, the department has paid special attention to the introduction of scientific results into the academic process. The results of scientific research are widely used in the performance of lecture, laboratory and practice lessons, as well as in the preparation of course designs, training and production practice. The department is given : Cabinet of Ministers Resolution of 824 \"On the procedure for introducing the credit-modular system in the educational process in higher education institutions\" and all the law \"On Education\" adopted by the President of the Republic of Uzbekistan on higher education, It works in accordance with the decisions of the Republic of Uzbekistan.\nCurrently, the department is organized in accordance with the Decree of the President of the Republic of Uzbekistan dated January 24, 2025 \"Bukhara State Technical Laboratory Decree No. PQ-22 \"On the establishment of the Bukhara Engineering and Technological Institute and the Bukhara Institute of Management of Natural Resources in the Bukhara State Technical University\" has its activity.\nThe professors and teachers of the department have introduced electronic textbooks, teaching aids, lecture texts, methodological instructions, control questions and test suites for use in the \"Ziyonet\" and international Internet networks. Video lessons in all subjects are constantly posted on YouTube.\nThe department includes \"Land cadastre and land management\", \"Geodesy and geoinformatics\", \"Ecology and environmental protection\", \"Hydrology\", \"Hydrology\", \"Mechanics of water management and meliorationleveling \",\" Hydrotechnical facilities and the use of pumping stations \"and other areas of education give lectures and practical lessons. Today, due to the peculiarities of the disciplines taught in the department, lessons are used with the use of \"presentation\", \"Mental attack\", \"Discussion\", \"6x6x6\", \"Black box\" and other types of pedagogical technology.', '[{\"key\":\"overview\",\"title\":\"\\u041e\\u0431\\u0437\\u043e\\u0440\",\"items\":[\"Department of Land Use and State Cadastre      \\n\\nHead of the Department of land use and state cadastres\\nAsatov Sayitqul Rahimberdiyevich\\n Reception time: Dushanba-Juma (14:00-16:00 gacha)\\n Phone: +998 (91) 91 408 50 13\\n Email: -\"]},{\"key\":\"history\",\"title\":\"\\u0418\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u0440\\u0438\\u044f \\u043a\\u0430\\u0444\\u0435\\u0434\\u0440\\u044b\",\"items\":[\"Taking into account the growing scale of tasks of improving the land reclamation state, as well as the peculiarities of the soil and climatic conditions, mineralization and salinity of agricultural lands in certain regions, including in the Bukhara valley, and in order to train highly qualified specialists for this important area of the country\'s economy, the Cabinet of Ministers of the Republic of Uzbekistan approved the Decree of the Cabinet of Ministers of the Republic of Uzbekistan dated August 20, 2010 \\\"Tashkent irrigation and On the organization of the Bukhara branch of the Institute of Melioration \\\"The Department of Land Management and Land Cadastre\\\" was organized as part of the organizational structure of the faculty \\\"Hydromelioration\\\".\\nThe department was organized with the name \\\"Land Planning and Land Cadastre\\\" in 2010. At present, it is called \\\"Land Use and State Cadastres\\\". Prominent scientists - professors S. Boriev and U. Tadzhiev made a great contribution to the development of the department for a long time. The department is headed by associate professor F. Hamidov, associate professor I. Islamov, and since 2022, associate professor S. Asatov. Based on their specialties, the faculty of the department \\\"Land Resources Use and State Cadastres\\\" are engaged in various problems in agriculture.\\nIn recent years, the department has paid special attention to the introduction of scientific results into the academic process. The results of scientific research are widely used in the performance of lecture, laboratory and practice lessons, as well as in the preparation of course designs, training and production practice. The department is given : Cabinet of Ministers Resolution of 824 \\\"On the procedure for introducing the credit-modular system in the educational process in higher education institutions\\\" and all the law \\\"On Education\\\" adopted by the President of the Republic of Uzbekistan on higher education, It works in accordance with the decisions of the Republic of Uzbekistan.\\nCurrently, the department is organized in accordance with the Decree of the President of the Republic of Uzbekistan dated January 24, 2025 \\\"Bukhara State Technical Laboratory Decree No. PQ-22 \\\"On the establishment of the Bukhara Engineering and Technological Institute and the Bukhara Institute of Management of Natural Resources in the Bukhara State Technical University\\\" has its activity.\\nThe professors and teachers of the department have introduced electronic textbooks, teaching aids, lecture texts, methodological instructions, control questions and test suites for use in the \\\"Ziyonet\\\" and international Internet networks. Video lessons in all subjects are constantly posted on YouTube.\\nThe department includes \\\"Land cadastre and land management\\\", \\\"Geodesy and geoinformatics\\\", \\\"Ecology and environmental protection\\\", \\\"Hydrology\\\", \\\"Hydrology\\\", \\\"Mechanics of water management and meliorationleveling \\\",\\\" Hydrotechnical facilities and the use of pumping stations \\\"and other areas of education give lectures and practical lessons. Today, due to the peculiarities of the disciplines taught in the department, lessons are used with the use of \\\"presentation\\\", \\\"Mental attack\\\", \\\"Discussion\\\", \\\"6x6x6\\\", \\\"Black box\\\" and other types of pedagogical technology.\"]},{\"key\":\"staff\",\"title\":\"\\u041f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0444\\u0435\\u0441\\u0441\\u043e\\u0440\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e-\\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435\\u043b\\u044c\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0441\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u0430\\u0432 \\u043a\\u0430\\u0444\\u0435\\u0434\\u0440\\u044b\",\"items\":[\"Head of the Department Doctor of Philosophy of Biological Sciences, Associate Professor\\nAsatov Sayitkul Rakhimberdiyevich\",\"Doctor of Philosophy of Technical Sciences, Professor.\\nHamidov Fayzullo Ramazonovich\",\"Doctor of Agricultural Sciences, Professor\\nIslamov Ismail\",\"Doctor of philosophy of technical sciences, professor\\nKhudoyberdiev Feruz Shamshodovich\",\"Doctor of philosophy of technical sciences, associate professor\\nSattorov Shahzod Yarashovich\",\"Doctor of Philosophy of Agricultural Sciences, associate professor\\nAdizov Shukhrat Bafoyevich\",\"Doctor of philosophy of technical sciences, associate professor\\nPirimov Jonibek Jumamurodovich\",\"Doctor of Philosophy of Biological Sciences Karimov\\nErkin Kadirovich\",\"Senior Lecturer\\nHamroyev Salahiddin Atoyevich\",\"Senior Lecturer\\nAbduloyev Ashraf Muzafarovich\",\"Senior teacher\\nAhmadov Behzod Obid oglu\",\"assistent\\nIzatov Elmir Najmidinovich\",\"assistent\\nEgamova Dilchehra Adizovna\",\"Assistant\\nNuriddinov Otabek Xurramovich\",\"assistent\\nOltinov Sobir Hayot o\'g\'li\",\"assistant\\nRajabova Gullola Islomovna\"]},{\"key\":\"prepared_specialists\",\"title\":\"\\u041f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0433\\u043e\\u0442\\u0430\\u0432\\u043b\\u0438\\u0432\\u0430\\u0435\\u043c\\u044b\\u0435 \\u0441\\u043f\\u0435\\u0446\\u0438\\u0430\\u043b\\u0438\\u0441\\u0442\\u044b\",\"items\":[\"BAKALAVRIAT\\n60811600 - Yer kadastri va yer tuzish\\n60721700 - Kadastr\\n60721500 - Geodeziya va geoinformatika\\n60721600 - Kartografiya va masofadan zondlash\\n60810300 - Tuproqlar bonitirovkasi va yer degradatsiyasi\\nMAGISTRATURA\\n70811601 \\u2013 Yer resurslaridan foydalanish va boshqarish\\n70721601 \\u2013 Yerni masofadan zondlash va GAT-texnologiyalari\",\"KAFEDRADA O\\u2018QITILADIGAN FANLAR\\nBakalavriat:\\n1. Kartografik dizayn;\\n2. Geodeziya;\\n3. Landshafshunoslik asoslari;\\n4. Kartografiya;\\n5. Davlat kadastri asoslari;\\n6. Mutaxassislikka kirish;\\n7. Oliy geodeziya;\\n8. Kartashunoslik;\\n9. Yer resurslarini boshqarish;\\n10. Zamonaviy geodezik asboblar;\\n11. Yer tuzishda geodezik ishlar;\\n12. Yer tuzishni loyihalash;\\n13. Yer tuzishning nazariy asoslari;\\n14. Hududlar kadastri ;\\n15. Raqamli kartografiya;\\n16. Ma\\u2019lumotlarni olish va integratsiyalash;\\n17. Raqamli yer kadastri;\\n18. Yer tuzishni loyihalashda avtomatlashgan tizimlar;\\n19. Yer tuzish ishlarini tashkil qilish va rejalshtirish;\\n20. Yer munosobatlarini tartibga solish;\\n21. Injenerlik geodeziyasi;\\n22. Tuproqshunoslik va o\\u2018simliklar anatomiyasi;\\n23. Tuproqshunoslik ;\\n24. Geoaxborot tizimlari asoslari;\\n25. Geoaxborot tizim va texnologiyalari;\\n26. Raqamli fotogrammeriya;\\n27. GAT da uch o`lchamli modellashtirish;\\n28. Geoma`lumotlar bazasi va arxitekturasi;\\nMagistratura\\n1. Ilmiy tadqiqot metodologiyasi\\n2. Yerdan foydalanishda integratsion boshqaruv\\n3. Hududlarni rivojlantirish\\n4. Yerdan foydalanish iqtisodi\\n5. Yer resurslarini boshqarishning huquqiy asoslari\\n6. Maxsus fanlarni o\\u2018qitish metodikasi\\n7. Yer uchastkalarini shakllantirish\\n8. Yer uchastkalarini hisobini yuritish va baholash\\n9. Ko`chmas mulkni boshqarish\",\"Darslik va o\\u2018quv qo\\u2018llanmalar\\n2024-2025 o\\u2018quv yilida Respublikada ta\\u2019lim sifatini oshirishga qaratilgan va zifalarning ijrosini ta\\u2019minlash hamda o\\u2018quv adabiyotlarining yangi avlodini yaratish konsepsiyasi talablari asosida kafedrada A.Abdulloyev, Sh.Sattorov, E.Karimov J.Primovlar tomonidan \\u201cKaratashunoslik\\u201d; A.Abdulloyev, Sh.Sattorov, S.Asatov, R.Oymatovlar tomonidan \\u201cInjenerlik geodeziyasi\\u201d; Sh.Adizov tomonidan \\u201cYer monitoringi\\u201d; S.Xamrayev tomonidan \\u201cBino-inshootlar davlat kadastri\\u201d; S.Asatov va F.Xudoyberdiyev tomonidan \\u201cYer uchastkalarini shakillantirish\\u201d o\\u2018quv qo\\u2018llanmalar va S.Xamrayev tomonidan \\u201cBino-inshootlar davlat kadastri\\u201d; F.Xudoyberdiyev tomonidan \\u201cYer uchastkalarini shakillantirish\\u201d nomli, darsliklar institut kengashidan o\\u2018tkazilib, oliy ta\\u2019lim va zirligi tomonidan guvohnomalar olindi va chop etish uchun tavsiya etildi.\"]},{\"key\":\"research\",\"title\":\"\\u041d\\u0430\\u0443\\u0447\\u043d\\u043e-\\u0438\\u0441\\u0441\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435\\u043b\\u044c\\u0441\\u043a\\u0430\\u044f \\u0440\\u0430\\u0431\\u043e\\u0442\\u0430\",\"items\":[\"Currently, 25 professor-teachers serve at the newly formed department. Of them 8 professors and PhD degrees, 6 associate professors, 2 senior lecturers and 9 assistants. The scientific potential is 36%. Over the last 14 years, 10 textbooks, 15 teaching aids, more than 1000 scientific articles, 56 methodological guidelines have been published by professors and teachers of the department.\\nNowadays, professors and students of the department conduct research on the following topics: Rational organization of the use of agricultural land in the conditions of environmental unstability (on the example of the Bukhara oasis), optimization of the composition of agricultural land species in clusters, introduction of innovative technologies for monitoring agricultural lands.\"]},{\"key\":\"cooperation\",\"title\":\"\\u0421\\u043e\\u0442\\u0440\\u0443\\u0434\\u043d\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u043e\",\"items\":[\"The department cooperates with the University of Usak in Turkey. From November 25 to December 6, 2024, a short-term internship was carried out by Khudoyberdiev F.Sh, Sattorov Sh.Y., Adizov Sh.B. and master\'s students Bobojonov S.O.\\nDuring the internship, as part of the exchange of experience between universities, lectures were organized by professors and teachers, and they got acquainted with the laboratory equipment. Electronic copies of necessary scientific literature were brought in from the Information Resource Center.\\nAn agreement was signed with the Faculty of Agriculture on the organization of online lectures on relevant subjects in Kefedra.\"]}]', 'Кафедра использования земельных ресурсов и государственного кадастра', 'Taking into account the growing scale of tasks of improving the land reclamation state, as well as the peculiarities of the soil and climatic conditions, mineralization and salinity of agricultural lands in certain regions, including in the Bukhara v', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-27 06:31:49'),
