(61, 16, 'en', 'Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization', 'Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization', 'The Department of Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization focuses on cutting-edge research in machine learning, deep learning, computer vision, natural language processing, and big data systems. We prepare specialists capable of leading digital transformation in industry and society.', NULL, 'Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization Dept', 'The Department of Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization focuses on cutting-edge research in machine learning, deep learning, computer vision, natural language processing, and big data systems. We', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-26 00:16:43'),
(62, 16, 'uz', 'Department of Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization', 'Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization', 'The Department of Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization focuses on Machine Learning algorithms, Big Data architectures, Deep Learning, computer vision, and national digitalization audits. We train AI developers who build neural networks, automate processes with AI, and analyze complex industrial data.', NULL, 'Department of Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization Dept', 'The Department of Artificial Intelligence and Digitalization focuses on Machine Learning algorithms, Big Data architectures, Deep Learning, computer vision, and national digitalization audits. We trai', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-26 00:16:43'),
(63, 16, 'ru', 'Искусственный интеллект и цифровизация', 'Искусственный интеллект и цифровизация', 'Кафедра искусственного интеллекта и цифровизации ориентирована на передовые исследования в области машинного обучения, глубокого обучения, компьютерного зрения, обработки естественного языка и систем больших данных. Мы готовим специалистов, способных возглавить цифровую трансформацию в промышленности и обществе.', NULL, 'Искусственный интеллект и цифровизация Dept', 'Кафедра искусственного интеллекта и цифровизации ориентирована на передовые исследования в области машинного обучения, глубокого обучения, компьютерного зрения, обработки естественного языка и систем ', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-26 00:16:43'),
(64, 16, 'ar', 'الذكاء الاصطناعي والرقمنة', 'الذكاء الاصطناعي والرقمنة', 'يركز قسم الذكاء الاصطناعي والرقمنة على الأبحاث المتطورة في مجالات تعلم الآلة، التعلم العميق، الرؤية الحاسوبية، معالجة اللغة الطبيعية، وأنظمة البيانات الضخمة. نعد متخصصين قادرين على قيادة التحول الرقمي في الصناعة والمجتمع.', NULL, 'الذكاء الاصطناعي والرقمنة Dept', 'يركز قسم الذكاء الاصطناعي والرقمنة على الأبحاث المتطورة في مجالات تعلم الآلة، التعلم العميق، الرؤية الحاسوبية، معالجة اللغة الطبيعية، وأنظمة البيانات الضخمة. نعد متخصصين قادرين على قيادة التحول الرقمي', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-26 00:16:43'),
(65, 17, 'en', 'Social Sciences and Physical Culture', 'Social Sciences and Physical Culture', '“Ijtimoiy fanlar va jismoniy madaniyat\" kafedrasi tarixi\nKafedra 1968 yilda tashkil topgan. 1975 yilda \"Falsafa\", 1979 yilda “Siyosiy tarix\" nomlari bilan atalgan. 1980 yil 3 ta mustaqil kafedra: \"Falsafa\", \"Siyosiy tarix\" va \"Siyosatshunoslik va huquq\" (Sobiq \"Ilmiy kommunizm\") kafedralari tashkil etildi.\n1992 yildan \"Falsafa\", \"O‘zbekiston tarixi\", \"Siyosatshunoslik va huquq” kafedrasi faoliyat ko‘rsatdi. 2005 yilga kelib \"Falsafa\", \"O‘zbekiston tarixi\", \"Siyosatshunoslik va huquq” kafedralar birlashtirilib \"Ijtimoiy fanlar\" kafedrasi nomi berildi.\n2011-2013 yilgacha \"Tarix va falsafa\" kafedrasi, 2013-2015 yilgacha \"Tarix\" kafedrasi, 2015 yildan “O‘zbekiston tarixi\" kafedrasi nomi bilan faoliyat yuritdi. 2020 yildan qayta \"Ijtimoiy fanlar\" kafedrasi nomi berildi, 2024 yil 1 sentyabrda BMTI strukturasida o’zgartirish kiritilib “Jismoniy madaniyat” kafedrasi (“Jismoniy madaniyat” kafedrasi avvalgi Buxoro oziq-ovqat va yengil sanoat texnologiya instituti hozirgi Buxoro muhandislik-texnologiya instituti tarkibida 1978 yilda tashkil topgan) bilan birlashtirildi va \"Ijtimoiy fanlar va jismoniy madaniyat\" kafedrasi deb nomlandi.\n2025 yil 1 apreldan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidentining 2025 yil 24 yanvardagi PQ-22-son qarori bilan tashkil etilgan Buxoro davlat texnika universiteti tarkibiga \"Ijtimoiy fanlar va jismoniy madaniyat\" kafedrasi nomi bilan kiritildi.', '[{\"key\":\"overview\",\"title\":\"Overview\",\"items\":[\"Department of Social Sciences and Physical Education     \\n\\nIjtimoiy fanlar va jismoniy madaniyat\\n\\nKafedra mudiri\\nMurodov Sanjar Aslonovich\\n Qabul vaqti: Har kuni 14:00-16:00\\n Telefon: +998 (91) 416 75 10\\n Email: -\"]},{\"key\":\"history\",\"title\":\"Department History\",\"items\":[\"\\u201cIjtimoiy fanlar va jismoniy madaniyat\\\" kafedrasi tarixi\\nKafedra 1968 yilda tashkil topgan. 1975 yilda \\\"Falsafa\\\", 1979 yilda \\u201cSiyosiy tarix\\\" nomlari bilan atalgan. 1980 yil 3 ta mustaqil kafedra: \\\"Falsafa\\\", \\\"Siyosiy tarix\\\" va \\\"Siyosatshunoslik va huquq\\\" (Sobiq \\\"Ilmiy kommunizm\\\") kafedralari tashkil etildi.\\n1992 yildan \\\"Falsafa\\\", \\\"O\\u2018zbekiston tarixi\\\", \\\"Siyosatshunoslik va huquq\\u201d kafedrasi faoliyat ko\\u2018rsatdi. 2005 yilga kelib \\\"Falsafa\\\", \\\"O\\u2018zbekiston tarixi\\\", \\\"Siyosatshunoslik va huquq\\u201d kafedralar birlashtirilib \\\"Ijtimoiy fanlar\\\" kafedrasi nomi berildi.\\n2011-2013 yilgacha \\\"Tarix va falsafa\\\" kafedrasi, 2013-2015 yilgacha \\\"Tarix\\\" kafedrasi, 2015 yildan \\u201cO\\u2018zbekiston tarixi\\\" kafedrasi nomi bilan faoliyat yuritdi. 2020 yildan qayta \\\"Ijtimoiy fanlar\\\" kafedrasi nomi berildi, 2024 yil 1 sentyabrda BMTI strukturasida o\\u2019zgartirish kiritilib \\u201cJismoniy madaniyat\\u201d kafedrasi (\\u201cJismoniy madaniyat\\u201d kafedrasi avvalgi Buxoro oziq-ovqat va yengil sanoat texnologiya instituti hozirgi Buxoro muhandislik-texnologiya instituti tarkibida 1978 yilda tashkil topgan) bilan birlashtirildi va \\\"Ijtimoiy fanlar va jismoniy madaniyat\\\" kafedrasi deb nomlandi.\\n2025 yil 1 apreldan O\\u2018zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidentining 2025 yil 24 yanvardagi PQ-22-son qarori bilan tashkil etilgan Buxoro davlat texnika universiteti tarkibiga \\\"Ijtimoiy fanlar va jismoniy madaniyat\\\" kafedrasi nomi bilan kiritildi.\",\"KAFEDRA PROFESSOR-O\\u2018QITUVCHILARI\",\"Kafedra mudiri v.v.b.\\nMuradov Sanjar Aslonovich\",\"Falsafa fanlari doktori Proffesor\\nNavro\\u2019zova Gulchehra Nigmatovna\",\"professor\\nZoyirov Erkin Xalilovich\",\"dotsent\\nNurmatova Nigora Umarovna\",\"dotsent\\nSafarov Tolib Tojievich\",\"dotsent\\nBafoyev Feruz Murtazoevich\",\"dotsent\\nShukurullayev Yunus Asrorovich\",\"dotsent\\nIsayeva Dilbar Abdukadirovna\",\"katta o\\u2019qituvchi\\nXodjayeva Sanobar Nasrullaevna\",\"dotsent\\nVohidova Munira Tulkinovna\",\"dotsent\\nBozorova Ro\\u2018zigul Sharofovna\",\"dotsent\\nKarimov Bozarqul Xuddayberdievich\",\"dotsent\\nKazakova Marifat Dexkanovna\",\"dotsent\\nSaloxov Akmal Kamariddinovich\",\"dotsent\\nAlimova Mohichehra Muzaffarovna\",\"dotsent\\nShodiyev Jahongir Jo\\u2018raqulovich\",\"katta o\\u2019qituvchi\\nAzimov Adiz Abdullaevich\",\"dotsent\\nXudoyqulov To\\u2018ymurod Bekmurodovich\",\"(t.f.n.) katta o\\u2019qituvchi\\nBerdiyeva Gulmira Aminovna\",\"dotsent\\nMamurov Baxrom Baxshulloevich\",\"katta o\\u2019qituvchi\\nSultonova Latofat Saydullaevna\",\"KAFEDRADA O\\u2018QITILADIGAN FANLAR\\nBakalavriat:\\n1. O`zbekistonning eng yangi tarixi\\n2. Falsafa\\n3. Dinshunoslik\\n4. Yangi tahrirdagi O\\u2018zbekiston Respublikasi Konstitutsiyasi\"]},{\"key\":\"publications\",\"title\":\"Textbooks and Articles\",\"items\":[\"Kafedrada quyidagi fanlar bo\\u2018yicha o\\u2018quv materiallarining elektron versiyalari ishlab chiqilishi va institut axborot-resurc markaziga topshirildi\\n1. \\\"Sotsiologiya fanidan uslubiy qo\\u2019llanma\\\" Bafoyev F.M.,Muradov S.A.\\n2. \\\"O\\u2018zbekiston eng yangi tarixi fanidan o\\u2018quv \\u2013 uslubiy majmua\\\" Nurmatova N.U.,Azimov A.A.\\n3. \\\"O\\u2019zbekistonni rivojlantirish strategiyasi. Fuqarolik jamiyati fanidan o\\u2018quv \\u2013 uslubiy majmua\\\" Alimova M.M,Mirzaqulov B.T\\n4. \\\"Ma\\u2019naviyatshunoslik fanidan o\\u2018quv \\u2013 uslubiy majmua\\\" Rahmonova M.A,Sultonova L.S,Qalandarova F.A.\\n5. \\\"Elektronniy modul po \\u201cFilosofii\\u201d\\\" Isaeva D\\n6. \\\"Elektronniy modul po \\u201cReligiovedeniyu\\u201d \\\" Isaeva D\\n7. \\\"Falsafa fanidan o\\u2018quv \\u2013 uslubiy majmua\\\" Voxidova M.T,Zoirov E.X.\\n8. \\\"UMK po \\u00abIstorii Uzbekistana\\u00bb\\\" Berdieva G.A.\"]},{\"key\":\"research\",\"title\":\"Research Work\",\"items\":[\"Ilmiy- tadqiqot 3 yo\\u2018nalishni qamrab oladi:\\n\\u2003  - XIX asrning oxiri-XX asr boshlarida Buxorodagi ijtimoiy-siyosiy va ma\\u2019naviy ahvol.\\n\\u2003  - Komil insonni shakllantirishning falsafiy va metodologik muammolari.\\n\\u2003  - Mustaqillik sharoitida jamiyatni demokratlashtirish masalalari.\",\"KAFEDRADA PROFESSOR-O\\u2019QITUVCHILAR TOMONISAN OLIB BORILAYOTGAN ILMIY IShLARNING MAVZULARI\\n1.Azimov A.A.Rudakiyning ijtimoiy axloqiy qarashlari.\\n2. Saloxov A.Q.Jadidchilik g\\u2018oyalarida yoshlar tolerantligini shallantirish muammolarining tarixiy-falsafiy tahlili\\n3. Qalandarova F.A.Yoshlarda hayotga pozitiv munosabatlarni shakllantirish jarayonlarning sotsiologik omillari\\n4. Alimova M.Sovet hukumati davrida Zarafshon vohasidagi ijtimoiy-iqtisodiy hayot\\n5. Bafoev F.M.\\u0421\\u0438\\u043d\\u0435\\u0440\\u0433\\u0435\\u0442\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0435 \\u0444\\u0430\\u043a\\u0442\\u043e\\u0440\\u044b \\u0441\\u043e\\u0432\\u0440\\u0435\\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u043e\\u043c \\u043c\\u0438\\u0440\\u043e\\u0432\\u043e\\u0439 \\u043f\\u043e\\u043b\\u0438\\u0442\\u0438\\u043a\\u0438\\n6. Zoirov \\u042d.X.Yaqubi Charxiyning ijtimoiy-falsafiy g\\u2019oyalari\"]},{\"key\":\"cooperation\",\"title\":\"Cooperation\",\"items\":[\"INTELEKTUAL MULK AGENTLIGI TOMONIDAN OLINGAN GUVOHNOMALAR\",\"OAK TOMONIDAN RO\\u2018YXATGA OLINGAN JURNALLARDA CHOP ETILGAN MAQOLALAR\",\"KAFEDRA PROFESSSOR-O\\u2018QITUVCHILARI TOMONIDAN 2021-2022 O\\u2018QUV YILDA CHOP ETILGAN O\\u2018QUV QO\\u2018LLANMALAR\"]}]', 'Social Sciences and Physical Culture', '“Ijtimoiy fanlar va jismoniy madaniyat\" kafedrasi tarixi\nKafedra 1968 yilda tashkil topgan. 1975 yilda \"Falsafa\", 1979 yilda “Siyosiy tarix\" nomlari bilan atalgan. 1980 yil 3 ta mustaqil kafedra: \"Falsafa\", \"Siyosiy tarix\" va \"Siyosatshunoslik va huq', '2026-07-26 00:16:43', '2026-07-27 06:31:55'),
