ence through Linguodidactics and Digital Tools\\u201d (Aqlli ta\\u2019lim: lingvodidaktika va raqamli vositalar yordamida chet tillarni o\\u2018qitish mahoratini oshirish) nomli konferentsiyada o\\u2019z ma\\u2019ruzalari bilan qatnashdilar.\"]},{\"key\":\"research\",\"title\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0639\\u0645\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u062d\\u062b\\u064a\\u0629\",\"items\":[\"Tillayeva Sh.M. \\\"Current theory and practice issues of teaching foreign languages\\\" Monografiya 2024 year\\nBarakatova D.A. \\\"Basic functions of dialectal vocabulary in modern language\\\" Monografiya 2024 yil\\nSalomova M.Z. Language teaching methodology\\\" Monograph 2024 Sharipova\\nF.N. \'Methods and approaches in vocabulary teaching and their influence on students\' \\\"That\\nwas the M.Sh.\\\" The role of modern technology in teaching English.\\\" Monografiya 2024 year\\nNurmuradova Sh.I. \\\"Semantico-pragmatic potential of an uncodified word\\\". Monograph 2024\\nAsrarova M. U.\\\" Qomusiy scientist of the oriental renaissance period (based on the translation of the works of M.N. Boltaev)\\\" Monograph 2024 year Sidikova\\nN.N.\\\" Actual issues of the organization of continuous study of foreign languages in all spheres of the education system in Uzbekistan\\\" Monograph: 2024. Izzatyllaeva\\nG. N. \\\"The role of believers in the development of youth thinking\\\" Monograph: 2024.\\nKazakova D.G. \\\"Working with authentic materials in teaching reading\\\" Monograph: 2024\\n. Musta\\u04b7imova \\u049a.S. \\\"National-cultural features of the modern language of advertising\\\" Monograph, 2025.\\nKaramatova Z.F. Typological features of the genre of elegy and marcia (on the example of English and Uzbek poetry) Monograph 2025 Shoyimkulova\\nM.Sh \\\"The role of modern technology in teaching English\\\" Monograph 2025 Karamatova\\nZ.F. \\\"World and uzbek poetry\\\" Monograph 2026 year\"]},{\"key\":\"cooperation\",\"title\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0648\\u0646\",\"items\":[\"Delegations from more than 100 countries of the world took part in the V International Kostomarov Forum, which was held in Moscow with the support of the Pushkin Institute of Russian Language and UNESCO. \\ud83d\\udcda During the forum, issues of promoting the Russian language, modern methodology, innovations in education, Russian language and intercultural communication were discussed. Akhtam Sariyev, a teacher of the Bukhara State Technical University, also took part in the delegation of Uzbekistan. He lectured on \\\"The functional state of the Russian language in Uzbekistan\\\" and \\\"Problems with methodological literature in higher educational institutions of Bukhara region\\\". This forum became an important platform for intercultural cooperation and the opportunity to learn best practices in teaching Russian language.\"]},{\"key\":\"plans\",\"title\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0637\\u0637 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0642\\u0628\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629\",\"items\":[\"In order to further increase their academic potential, teachers of the department participate in the Faculty Enrichment Program (FEP) at conferences and seminars organized by the British Council and the English Language Teachers\' Association. Therefore, a library with French literature is being established in cooperation with the French Embassy. Teachers record and publish over 80 textbooks, teaching materials, bilingual dictionaries. Lecturers also participate in scientific seminars and conferences with their articles in collections of conferences and scientific journals, both at home and abroad. The teaching of English and French languages, modern advanced methods and principles and the experience of developed countries are used in the teaching of English and French languages.\",\"\\u0644\\u064a\\u0643\\u0646 \\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0643 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0646 \\u0643\\u0644 \\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0647\\u0627 \\u0627\\u06