(5, 2, 'en', 'Information Systems Security & Cybersecurity', 'Specialized training in network security, cryptography, threat assessment, and secure software development.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in national Mathematics and Informatics exams\nAnalytical and logic test clearance', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Introduction to Cryptography\nNetwork Security Protocols\nEthical Hacking and Auditing\nDigital Forensics & Investigation\nSecure Software Development\nInformation Security Compliance', 'Cybersecurity Analyst\nInformation Security Officer\nEthical Hacker / Penetration Tester\nNetwork Security Engineer\nDigital Forensics Examiner', 'Information Systems Security & Cybersecurity Bachelor', 'The Information Systems Security & Cybersecurity program at BSTU provides comprehensive education in protecting networks, computers, programs, and data from attack, damage, or unauthorized access. Stu', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-26 00:16:44'),
