(9, 3, 'en', 'Oil and Gas Engineering', 'Oil and Gas Engineering is offered by the Faculty of Technology with department-based academic and practical training.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in Chemistry and Mathematics exams\nIndustrial safety compliance', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Reservoir Engineering\nDrilling and Extraction\nPetroleum Refining Technology\nNatural Gas Processing\nPetrochemical Synthesis\nPipeline Logistics and Safety', 'Refinery Process Engineer\nDrilling Engineer\nReservoir Engineer\nPetrochemical Quality Specialist\nPipeline Operations Manager', 'Oil and Gas Engineering Bachelor', 'Oil and Gas Engineering is offered by the Faculty of Technology with department-based academic and practical training.', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-27 06:31:35'),
