(11, 3, 'ru', 'Нефтегазовая инженерия', 'Нефтегазовая инженерия реализуется на факультете технологий с кафедральной теоретической и практической подготовкой.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in Chemistry and Mathematics exams\nIndustrial safety compliance', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Reservoir Engineering\nDrilling and Extraction\nPetroleum Refining Technology\nNatural Gas Processing\nPetrochemical Synthesis\nPipeline Logistics and Safety', 'Refinery Process Engineer\nDrilling Engineer\nReservoir Engineer\nPetrochemical Quality Specialist\nPipeline Operations Manager', 'Нефтегазовая инженерия Bachelor', 'Нефтегазовая инженерия реализуется на факультете технологий с кафедральной теоретической и практической подготовкой.', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-27 06:31:35'),
(12, 3, 'ar', 'هندسة النفط والغاز', 'يُقدَّم برنامج هندسة النفط والغاز في كلية التكنولوجيا مع تدريب أكاديمي وعملي تابع للقسم.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in Chemistry and Mathematics exams\nIndustrial safety compliance', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Reservoir Engineering\nDrilling and Extraction\nPetroleum Refining Technology\nNatural Gas Processing\nPetrochemical Synthesis\nPipeline Logistics and Safety', 'Refinery Process Engineer\nDrilling Engineer\nReservoir Engineer\nPetrochemical Quality Specialist\nPipeline Operations Manager', 'هندسة النفط والغاز Bachelor', 'يُقدَّم برنامج هندسة النفط والغاز في كلية التكنولوجيا مع تدريب أكاديمي وعملي تابع للقسم.', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-27 06:31:35'),
(13, 4, 'en', 'Automotive Engineering', 'Automotive systems design, internal combustion engines, transport logistics, and vehicle assembly.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in Physics and Mathematics exams\nCAD modeling skills recommended', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Vehicle Design and Dynamics\nInternal Combustion Engines\nAutomotive Electronics\nTransmission Systems\nVehicle Safety Standards\nTransportation Logistics', 'Automotive Design Engineer\nAssembly Line Manager\nVehicle Safety Auditor\nAutomotive Electronics Specialist\nLogistics Engineer', 'Automotive Engineering Bachelor', 'The Automotive Engineering program covers vehicle design, engine performance, transmission systems, automotive electronics, and assembly logistics. Given the scale of automotive manufacturing in Uzbek', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-26 00:16:44'),
